<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Leere Verzeichnisse finden &amp; l&ouml;schen</title>
<HTA:APPLICATION
  ID="EmptyFolderCleaner"
  APPLICATIONNAME="EmptyFolderCleaner"
  BORDER="thick"
  BORDERSTYLE="normal"
  CAPTION="yes"
  SHOWINTASKBAR="yes"
  SYSMENU="yes"
  INNERBORDER="no"
  MAXIMIZEBUTTON="yes"
  MINIMIZEBUTTON="yes"
  WINDOWSTATE="normal"
  SINGLEINSTANCE="yes"
  CONTEXTMENU="yes"
  SCROLL="no"
/>
<style type="text/css">
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #1e293b;
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .app {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* Kopfzeile */
  .header {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    background-color: #0f172a;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
  }
  .header-sub {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Steuerbereich */
  .controls {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
  }
  .path-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .path-input {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    height: 34px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #0f172a;
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #94a3b8;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .path-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #2563eb;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .options-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #334155;
  }
  .opt-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-right: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .opt-label input {
    margin-right: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* Filter- und Auswahlleiste */
  .list-toolbar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    background-color: #e2e8f0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
  }
  .toolbar-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .filter-input {
    height: 28px;
    width: 240px;
    padding: 0 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    border: 1px solid #94a3b8;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  .filter-input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #2563eb;
  }

  /* Ergebnisliste */
  .list-wrapper {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    position: relative;
    min-height: 120px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  .list-scroll {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 6px 0;
  }

  .empty-state {
    padding: 40px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .folder-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }
  .folder-row:nth-child(even) {
    background-color: #f8fafc;
  }
  .folder-row:hover {
    background-color: #eff6ff;
  }
  .folder-row.selected {
    background-color: #fee2e2;
  }
  .folder-row.selected:hover {
    background-color: #fecaca;
  }
  .folder-row.error-row {
    background-color: #fef3c7;
  }
  .folder-row.error-row:hover {
    background-color: #fde68a;
  }

  .folder-cb {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    margin: 0 10px 0 0;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .folder-link {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    font-family: Consolas, "Cascadia Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #0f172a;
    text-decoration: none;
    word-break: break-all;
    padding-right: 10px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .folder-link:hover {
    color: #1d4ed8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .row-right {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .folder-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .badge-direct {
    background-color: #e2e8f0;
    color: #334155;
  }
  .badge-nested {
    background-color: #dbeafe;
    color: #1e40af;
  }
  .badge-meta {
    background-color: #fef3c7;
    color: #92400e;
  }
  .badge-error {
    background-color: #dc2626;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .row-btn {
    height: 24px;
    padding: 0 8px;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1e293b;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #94a3b8;
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-left: 4px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .row-btn:hover {
    background-color: #2563eb;
    border-color: #2563eb;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Fu&szlig;zeile */
  .footer {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    background-color: #f8fafc;
    border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
  }
  .status-text {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #334155;
    padding-right: 12px;
  }
  .status-text strong {
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .actions {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn {
    height: 34px;
    padding: 0 14px;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-left: 8px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .btn:first-child {
    margin-left: 0;
  }
  .btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.45;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .btn-sm {
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #1e293b;
    border-color: #94a3b8;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: #f1f5f9;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background-color: #2563eb;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: #1d4ed8;
  }
  .btn-danger {
    background-color: #dc2626;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .btn-danger:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background-color: #b91c1c;
  }
</style>
<script type="text/javascript">
  var fso = new ActiveXObject("Scripting.FileSystemObject");
  var wshShell = new ActiveXObject("WScript.Shell");
  var appShell = new ActiveXObject("Shell.Application");
  var envProc = wshShell.Environment("PROCESS");

  var winDirLower = "";
  var programDataLower = "";
  try { winDirLower = (envProc("windir") || "").toLowerCase(); } catch (e) {}
  try { programDataLower = (envProc("ProgramData") || "").toLowerCase(); } catch (e) {}

  var EXCLUDED_NAMES = {
    "system volume information": true,
    "$recycle.bin": true,
    "recycler": true,
    "recycled": true,
    "recovery": true,
    "config.msi": true,
    "msocache": true,
    "$winreagent": true
  };

  var foundFolders = [];
  var lastScanMetaEnabled = false;
  var isBusy = false;

  function initWindow() {
    var targetW = 1020;
    var targetH = 680;
    try {
      var sw = window.screen.availWidth || 1280;
      var sh = window.screen.availHeight || 800;
      if (targetW > sw - 40) targetW = sw - 40;
      if (targetH > sh - 40) targetH = sh - 40;
      window.resizeTo(targetW, targetH);
      window.moveTo(Math.max(0, Math.floor((sw - targetW) / 2)), Math.max(0, Math.floor((sh - targetH) / 2)));
    } catch (e) {}

    updateFooter();
  }

  function escapeHtml(str) {
    return String(str)
      .replace(/&/g, "&amp;")
      .replace(/</g, "&lt;")
      .replace(/>/g, "&gt;")
      .replace(/"/g, "&quot;")
      .replace(/'/g, "&#39;");
  }

  function normalizePath(p) {
    if (!p) return "";
    p = p.trim();
    if (p.length >= 2 && p.charAt(0) === '"' && p.charAt(p.length - 1) === '"') {
      p = p.substring(1, p.length - 1).trim();
    }
    while (p.length > 3 && p.charAt(p.length - 1) === "\\") {
      p = p.substring(0, p.length - 1);
    }
    if (p.length === 2 && p.charAt(1) === ":") {
      p = p + "\\";
    }
    return p;
  }

  function getPathDepth(p) {
    var parts = p.split("\\");
    var count = 0;
    for (var i = 0; i < parts.length; i++) {
      if (parts[i].length > 0) count++;
    }
    return count;
  }

  function isSystemExcluded(folderName, folderPath) {
    var nameLower = folderName.toLowerCase();
    if (EXCLUDED_NAMES[nameLower]) return true;
    var pathLower = folderPath.toLowerCase();
    if (winDirLower && pathLower === winDirLower) return true;
    if (programDataLower && pathLower === programDataLower) return true;
    return false;
  }

  function setBusy(busy, message) {
    isBusy = busy;
    document.getElementById("btnBrowse").disabled = busy;
    document.getElementById("btnScan").disabled = busy;
    document.getElementById("btnDelete").disabled = busy || getSelectedCount() === 0;
    document.getElementById("btnSelectAll").disabled = busy || foundFolders.length === 0;
    document.getElementById("btnSelectNone").disabled = busy || foundFolders.length === 0;
    document.getElementById("btnCleanupList").disabled = busy || foundFolders.length === 0;
    document.getElementById("txtPath").disabled = busy;
    if (message) {
      document.getElementById("statusText").innerHTML = message;
    }
  }

  function browseFolder() {
    if (isBusy) return;
    try {
      var selected = appShell.BrowseForFolder(0, "Startordner f\u00fcr die Suche ausw\u00e4hlen:", 0x0011, 0);
      if (selected && selected.Self && selected.Self.Path) {
        document.getElementById("txtPath").value = selected.Self.Path;
        startScan();
      }
    } catch (e) {
      alert("Ordnerauswahl fehlgeschlagen: " + e.message);
    }
  }

  function onPathKeyDown(evt) {
    evt = evt || window.event;
    if (evt.keyCode === 13) {
      startScan();
    }
  }

  function startScan() {
    if (isBusy) return;
    var rawPath = document.getElementById("txtPath").value;
    var rootPath = normalizePath(rawPath);
    document.getElementById("txtPath").value = rootPath;

    if (!rootPath) {
      browseFolder();
      return;
    }
    if (!fso.FolderExists(rootPath)) {
      alert("Der angegebene Ordner existiert nicht oder ist nicht erreichbar:\n" + rootPath);
      return;
    }

    var opts = {
      skipSystem: document.getElementById("chkSkipSys").checked,
      includeNested: document.getElementById("chkNested").checked,
      ignoreMeta: document.getElementById("chkIgnoreMeta").checked
    };
    lastScanMetaEnabled = opts.ignoreMeta;

    foundFolders = [];
    document.getElementById("txtFilter").value = "";
    document.getElementById("listContainer").innerHTML =
      '<div class="empty-state">Durchsuche <strong>' + escapeHtml(rootPath) +
      '</strong>...<br>Bei gro&szlig;en Laufwerken kann dies einige Sekunden dauern.</div>';
    setBusy(true, "Suche l&auml;uft in <strong>" + escapeHtml(rootPath) + "</strong>...");

    window.setTimeout(function() {
      var t0 = new Date().getTime();
      var stats = { scanned: 0, skipped: 0 };

      function walk(folderObj, isRoot) {
        stats.scanned++;
        var fPath = "";
        try {
          fPath = folderObj.Path;
          if ((folderObj.Attributes & 1024) !== 0) {
            stats.skipped++;
            return false;
          }
          if (!isRoot && opts.skipSystem && isSystemExcluded(folderObj.Name, fPath)) {
            stats.skipped++;
            return false;
          }
        } catch (e) {
          stats.skipped++;
          return false;
        }

        var hasRealFiles = false;
        var hasMetaFiles = false;
        try {
          var fileCount = folderObj.Files.Count;
          if (fileCount > 0) {
            if (!opts.ignoreMeta) {
              hasRealFiles = true;
            } else {
              var fEnum = new Enumerator(folderObj.Files);
              for (; !fEnum.atEnd(); fEnum.moveNext()) {
                var fn = fEnum.item().Name.toLowerCase();
                if (fn === "desktop.ini" || fn === "thumbs.db") {
                  hasMetaFiles = true;
                } else {
                  hasRealFiles = true;
                  break;
                }
              }
            }
          }
        } catch (e) {
          stats.skipped++;
          return false;
        }

        var subCount = 0;
        var allSubsEmpty = true;
        try {
          var sEnum = new Enumerator(folderObj.SubFolders);
          for (; !sEnum.atEnd(); sEnum.moveNext()) {
            subCount++;
            var subEmpty = walk(sEnum.item(), false);
            if (!subEmpty) {
              allSubsEmpty = false;
            }
          }
        } catch (e) {
          stats.skipped++;
          return false;
        }

        var thisIsEmpty = (!hasRealFiles) && allSubsEmpty;

        if (!isRoot && thisIsEmpty) {
          var isDirect = (subCount === 0);
          if (isDirect || opts.includeNested) {
            var badgeText = "";
            var badgeClass = "badge-direct";
            if (isDirect) {
              if (hasMetaFiles) {
                badgeText = "Nur Metadaten";
                badgeClass = "badge-meta";
              } else {
                badgeText = "Leer";
                badgeClass = "badge-direct";
              }
            } else {
              if (hasMetaFiles) {
                badgeText = "Leere Unterordner + Metadaten";
                badgeClass = "badge-meta";
              } else {
                badgeText = "Nur leere Unterordner";
                badgeClass = "badge-nested";
              }
            }

            foundFolders.push({
              path: fPath,
              depth: getPathDepth(fPath),
              badgeText: badgeText,
              badgeClass: badgeClass,
              selected: true,
              errorMsg: ""
            });
          }
        }

        return thisIsEmpty;
      }

      try {
        var rootObj = fso.GetFolder(rootPath);
        walk(rootObj, true);
      } catch (err) {
        alert("Fehler beim Lesen des Startordners:\n" + err.message);
      }

      foundFolders.sort(function(a, b) {
        var pa = a.path.toLowerCase();
        var pb = b.path.toLowerCase();
        if (pa < pb) return -1;
        if (pa > pb) return 1;
        return 0;
      });

      var elapsed = ((new Date().getTime() - t0) / 1000).toFixed(1).replace(".", ",");
      renderList();
      setBusy(false);
      updateFooter(
        "<strong>" + foundFolders.length + "</strong> leere Ordner gefunden (" +
        stats.scanned + " gepr&uuml;ft, " + stats.skipped + " &uuml;bersprungen, " + elapsed + " s)."
      );
    }, 40);
  }

  function getFilteredIndices() {
    var q = (document.getElementById("txtFilter").value || "").trim().toLowerCase();
    var indices = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < foundFolders.length; i++) {
      if (!q || foundFolders[i].path.toLowerCase().indexOf(q) !== -1) {
        indices.push(i);
      }
    }
    return indices;
  }

  function renderList() {
    var container = document.getElementById("listContainer");
    if (foundFolders.length === 0) {
      container.innerHTML =
        '<div class="empty-state">Keine leeren Verzeichnisse in der Liste.<br>' +
        'W&auml;hle oben einen Ordner aus und klicke auf <strong>Scannen</strong>.</div>';
      updateFooter();
      return;
    }

    var indices = getFilteredIndices();
    if (indices.length === 0) {
      container.innerHTML =
        '<div class="empty-state">Kein gefundener Ordner entspricht dem aktuellen Filter.</div>';
      updateFooter();
      return;
    }

    var html = [];
    for (var k = 0; k < indices.length; k++) {
      var idx = indices[k];
      var item = foundFolders[idx];
      var rowCls = "folder-row";
      if (item.errorMsg) {
        rowCls += " error-row";
      } else if (item.selected) {
        rowCls += " selected";
      }

      var badgeHtml = item.errorMsg
        ? '<span class="folder-badge badge-error" title="' + escapeHtml(item.errorMsg) + '">' + escapeHtml(item.errorMsg) + '</span>'
        : '<span class="folder-badge ' + item.badgeClass + '">' + item.badgeText + '</span>';

      html.push(
        '<div class="' + rowCls + '" id="row_' + idx + '">' +
          '<input type="checkbox" class="folder-cb" id="cb_' + idx + '"' + (item.selected ? ' checked="checked"' : '') + ' onclick="toggleCheckbox(' + idx + ')" title="F\u00fcr automatisches L\u00f6schen markieren" />' +
          '<a href="#" class="folder-link" onclick="openFolder(' + idx + ', false); return false;" title="Klicken, um diesen Ordner direkt im Explorer zu \u00f6ffnen">' + escapeHtml(item.path) + '</a>' +
          '<div class="row-right">' +
            badgeHtml +
            '<button type="button" class="row-btn" onclick="openFolder(' + idx + ', false)" title="Ordner im Explorer \u00f6ffnen (Inhalt pr\u00fcfen)">&Ouml;ffnen</button>' +
            '<button type="button" class="row-btn" onclick="openFolder(' + idx + ', true)" title="Im \u00dcberordner markieren (ideal zum manuellen L\u00f6schen mit Entf)">&Uuml;berordner</button>' +
          '</div>' +
        '</div>'
      );
    }

    container.innerHTML = html.join("");
    updateFooter();
  }

  function applyRowVisual(idx) {
    var item = foundFolders[idx];
    var row = document.getElementById("row_" + idx);
    var cb = document.getElementById("cb_" + idx);
    if (cb) cb.checked = item.selected;
    if (row) {
      var cls = "folder-row";
      if (item.errorMsg) {
        cls += " error-row";
      } else if (item.selected) {
        cls += " selected";
      }
      row.className = cls;
    }
  }

  function toggleCheckbox(idx) {
    var cb = document.getElementById("cb_" + idx);
    foundFolders[idx].selected = cb ? cb.checked : !foundFolders[idx].selected;
    applyRowVisual(idx);
    updateFooter();
  }

  function selectVisible(state) {
    var indices = getFilteredIndices();
    for (var i = 0; i < indices.length; i++) {
      var idx = indices[i];
      foundFolders[idx].selected = state;
      applyRowVisual(idx);
    }
    updateFooter();
  }

  function openFolder(idx, selectInParent) {
    var item = foundFolders[idx];
    if (!item) return;

    var targetPath = item.path;

    // Falls der Ordner bereits manuell gel\u00f6scht wurde, direkt aus der Liste nehmen
    if (!fso.FolderExists(targetPath)) {
      foundFolders.splice(idx, 1);
      renderList();
      updateFooter("Ordner existiert nicht mehr und wurde aus der Liste entfernt: <strong>" + escapeHtml(targetPath) + "</strong>");
      return;
    }

    try {
      if (selectInParent) {
        wshShell.Run('explorer.exe /select,"' + targetPath + '"', 1, false);
        updateFooter("Im &Uuml;berordner markiert: <strong>" + escapeHtml(targetPath) + "</strong>");
      } else {
        wshShell.Run('explorer.exe "' + targetPath + '"', 1, false);
        updateFooter("Ge&ouml;ffnet: <strong>" + escapeHtml(targetPath) + "</strong>");
      }
    } catch (e) {
      // Fallback bei \u00fcberlangen Pfaden: n\u00e4chsth\u00f6heren existierenden Elternordner \u00f6ffnen
      var fallback = targetPath;
      var opened = false;
      for (var step = 0; step < 10; step++) {
        fallback = fso.GetParentFolderName(fallback);
        if (!fallback) break;
        if (fso.FolderExists(fallback)) {
          try {
            wshShell.Run('explorer.exe "' + fallback + '"', 1, false);
            updateFooter("Pfad zu lang f&uuml;r direkten Aufruf &ndash; &Uuml;berordner ge&ouml;ffnet: <strong>" + escapeHtml(fallback) + "</strong>");
            opened = true;
            break;
          } catch (e2) {}
        }
      }
      if (!opened) {
        alert("Ordner konnte nicht im Explorer ge\u00f6ffnet werden:\n" + targetPath + "\n\n" + e.message);
      }
    }
  }

  function cleanupDeletedFromList() {
    if (isBusy || foundFolders.length === 0) return;
    var remaining = [];
    var removed = 0;
    for (var i = 0; i < foundFolders.length; i++) {
      if (fso.FolderExists(foundFolders[i].path)) {
        remaining.push(foundFolders[i]);
      } else {
        removed++;
      }
    }
    foundFolders = remaining;
    renderList();
    if (removed > 0) {
      updateFooter("<strong>" + removed + "</strong> bereits gel&ouml;schte Ordner aus der Liste entfernt.");
    } else {
      updateFooter("Alle <strong>" + foundFolders.length + "</strong> gelisteten Ordner existieren noch.");
    }
  }

  function getSelectedCount() {
    var count = 0;
    for (var i = 0; i < foundFolders.length; i++) {
      if (foundFolders[i].selected) count++;
    }
    return count;
  }

  function updateFooter(customMessage) {
    var sel = getSelectedCount();
    var total = foundFolders.length;
    document.getElementById("btnDelete").disabled = isBusy || sel === 0;
    document.getElementById("btnDelete").innerHTML = "Markierte l&ouml;schen (" + sel + ")";
    document.getElementById("btnSelectAll").disabled = isBusy || total === 0;
    document.getElementById("btnSelectNone").disabled = isBusy || total === 0;
    document.getElementById("btnCleanupList").disabled = isBusy || total === 0;

    if (customMessage) {
      document.getElementById("statusText").innerHTML = customMessage;
    } else if (total > 0) {
      document.getElementById("statusText").innerHTML =
        "<strong>" + sel + "</strong> von <strong>" + total + "</strong> markiert &bull; Klick auf Pfad &ouml;ffnet im Explorer.";
    } else {
      document.getElementById("statusText").innerHTML = "Bereit. Bitte einen Ordner ausw&auml;hlen oder Pfad eingeben.";
    }
  }

  function safeDeleteSingle(item, forceAttrs, allowMeta) {
    if (!fso.FolderExists(item.path)) {
      return { ok: true, msg: "" };
    }

    var folder;
    try {
      folder = fso.GetFolder(item.path);
    } catch (e) {
      return { ok: false, msg: "Kein Zugriff" };
    }

    try {
      if ((folder.Attributes & 1024) !== 0) {
        return { ok: false, msg: "Verkn\u00fcpfung \u00fcbersprungen" };
      }
    } catch (e) {}

    try {
      if (folder.SubFolders.Count > 0) {
        return { ok: false, msg: "Enth\u00e4lt noch Unterordner" };
      }
    } catch (e) {
      return { ok: false, msg: "Unterordner nicht pr\u00fcfbar" };
    }

    try {
      if (folder.Files.Count > 0) {
        if (!allowMeta) {
          return { ok: false, msg: "Nicht mehr leer (Dateien vorhanden)" };
        }
        var metaFiles = [];
        var fEnum = new Enumerator(folder.Files);
        for (; !fEnum.atEnd(); fEnum.moveNext()) {
          var f = fEnum.item();
          var fn = f.Name.toLowerCase();
          if (fn !== "desktop.ini" && fn !== "thumbs.db") {
            return { ok: false, msg: "Enth\u00e4lt normale Dateien" };
          }
          metaFiles.push(f);
        }
        for (var m = 0; m < metaFiles.length; m++) {
          try {
            if (forceAttrs) { metaFiles[m].Attributes = 0; }
            metaFiles[m].Delete(true);
          } catch (me) {
            return { ok: false, msg: "Metadatei gesperrt" };
          }
        }
      }
    } catch (e) {
      return { ok: false, msg: "Dateien nicht pr\u00fcfbar" };
    }

    try {
      if (folder.Files.Count > 0 || folder.SubFolders.Count > 0) {
        return { ok: false, msg: "Ordner ist nicht leer" };
      }
    } catch (e) {
      return { ok: false, msg: "Pr\u00fcfung fehlgeschlagen" };
    }

    try {
      if (forceAttrs) {
        try { folder.Attributes = 0; } catch (ae) {}
      }
      fso.DeleteFolder(item.path, forceAttrs);
      return { ok: true, msg: "" };
    } catch (de) {
      if (forceAttrs) {
        try {
          var cmdPath = item.path.replace(/%/g, "%%");
          var rc = wshShell.Run('cmd /c rd "' + cmdPath + '"', 0, true);
          if (rc === 0 && !fso.FolderExists(item.path)) {
            return { ok: true, msg: "" };
          }
        } catch (ce) {}
      }
      return { ok: false, msg: "Gesperrt / Zugriff verweigert" };
    }
  }

  function deleteSelected() {
    if (isBusy) return;
    var selectedCount = getSelectedCount();
    if (selectedCount === 0) return;

    var forceAttrs = document.getElementById("chkForce").checked;
    var confirmMsg =
      "Sollen " + selectedCount + " markierte leere Ordner endg\u00fcltig gel\u00f6scht werden?\n\n" +
      "(Ordner werden nicht in den Papierkorb verschoben. Nicht-leere Ordner werden aus Sicherheit automatisch \u00fcbersprungen.)";
    if (!confirm(confirmMsg)) return;

    setBusy(true, "L&ouml;sche <strong>" + selectedCount + "</strong> markierte Ordner...");

    window.setTimeout(function() {
      var toDelete = [];
      for (var i = 0; i < foundFolders.length; i++) {
        if (foundFolders[i].selected) {
          toDelete.push(foundFolders[i]);
        }
      }
      toDelete.sort(function(a, b) {
        if (b.depth !== a.depth) return b.depth - a.depth;
        return b.path.length - a.path.length;
      });

      var deletedCount = 0;
      var failedCount = 0;
      var deletedMap = {};

      for (var j = 0; j < toDelete.length; j++) {
        var item = toDelete[j];
        var res = safeDeleteSingle(item, forceAttrs, lastScanMetaEnabled);
        if (res.ok) {
          deletedCount++;
          deletedMap[item.path.toLowerCase()] = true;
        } else {
          failedCount++;
          item.errorMsg = res.msg;
          item.selected = false;
        }
      }

      var remaining = [];
      for (var r = 0; r < foundFolders.length; r++) {
        if (!deletedMap[foundFolders[r].path.toLowerCase()]) {
          remaining.push(foundFolders[r]);
        }
      }
      foundFolders = remaining;

      renderList();
      setBusy(false);

      var summary = "<strong>" + deletedCount + "</strong> Ordner gel&ouml;scht.";
      if (failedCount > 0) {
        summary += " <span style=\"color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;\">" + failedCount + " fehlgeschlagen (gelb markiert).</span>";
      }
      updateFooter(summary);
    }, 40);
  }

  function closeApp() {
    window.close();
  }
</script>
</head>
<body onload="initWindow()">
  <div class="app">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-title">Leere Verzeichnisse finden &amp; l&ouml;schen</div>
      <div class="header-sub">Findet sicher alle wirklich leeren Ordner (inkl. verschachtelter leerer Ordnerb&auml;ume) ohne 0-Byte-Dateien zu gef&auml;hrden.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="controls">
      <div class="path-row">
        <input type="text" id="txtPath" class="path-input" placeholder="Ordnerpfad eingeben (z. B. D:\Daten) oder rechts ausw&auml;hlen..." onkeydown="onPathKeyDown(event)" />
        <button type="button" id="btnBrowse" class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="browseFolder()">Ordner w&auml;hlen...</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnScan" class="btn btn-primary" onclick="startScan()">Scannen</button>
      </div>
      <div class="options-row">
        <label class="opt-label" title="&Uuml;berspringt Windows, ProgramData, Papierkorb ($Recycle.Bin) und System Volume Information">
          <input type="checkbox" id="chkSkipSys" checked="checked" />Windows- &amp; Systemordner ausklammern
        </label>
        <label class="opt-label" title="Findet auch Elternordner, die ausschlie&szlig;lich leere Unterordner enthalten">
          <input type="checkbox" id="chkNested" checked="checked" />Leere Ordnerb&auml;ume einbeziehen
        </label>
        <label class="opt-label" title="Wertet Ordner, die nur versteckte Windows-Dateien (desktop.ini / Thumbs.db) enthalten, ebenfalls als leer">
          <input type="checkbox" id="chkIgnoreMeta" />desktop.ini &amp; Thumbs.db ignorieren
        </label>
        <label class="opt-label" title="Entfernt Schreibschutz-/Versteckt-Attribute auf leeren Ordnern vor dem L&ouml;schen (l&ouml;scht niemals Dateien)">
          <input type="checkbox" id="chkForce" />Schreibschutz entfernen
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="list-toolbar">
      <div class="toolbar-left">
        <button type="button" id="btnSelectAll" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="selectVisible(true)" disabled="disabled">Alle markieren</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnSelectNone" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="selectVisible(false)" disabled="disabled">Auswahl aufheben</button>
        <button type="button" id="btnCleanupList" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="cleanupDeletedFromList()" disabled="disabled" title="Entfernt Ordner aus der Liste, die inzwischen manuell im Explorer gel&ouml;scht wurden">Gel&ouml;schte entfernen</button>
      </div>
      <input type="text" id="txtFilter" class="filter-input" placeholder="Ergebnisse filtern..." onkeyup="renderList()" />
    </div>

    <div class="list-wrapper">
      <div class="list-scroll" id="listContainer">
        <div class="empty-state">
          Klicke oben auf <strong>Ordner w&auml;hlen...</strong> oder f&uuml;ge direkt einen Pfad ein (auch Netzwerkpfade wie <code>\\Server\Freigabe</code>) und starte den Scan.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <div class="status-text" id="statusText">Bereit.</div>
      <div class="actions">
        <button type="button" id="btnDelete" class="btn btn-danger" onclick="deleteSelected()" disabled="disabled">Markierte l&ouml;schen (0)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="closeApp()">Beenden</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>